    "paragraphs": [
      "In the last 90 days, the website generated 26 enquiries from 505 visitors, down from 74 enquiries from 743 visitors during the same 90 days a year ago. It now takes 19 visitors to achieve one enquiry, compared to 10 last year. Over the last 30 days, visitors rose to 176 from 147 in the 30 days before, but enquiries slipped to 7 from 8, lifting visitor requirements to 25 people per conversion from 18.",
      "This drop stems from audience intent shifting alongside internal search competition. Traffic has tilted toward informational content like your brand identity guide, which drew 593 visits but yielded only 1 conversion from visits that started on it, made anywhere on the website, over the last 12 months. Meanwhile, multiple service pages are competing against each other in Google searches—especially across web design and app development—splitting clicks and keeping valuable commercial pages on page two of search results.",
      "Across the market, search demand contracted for all agencies over the year, but your underlying share is growing. While competitors saw estimated monthly search visits drop, including chilliapple falling from 6,616 to 2,637 and plugandplaydesign dropping from 4,387 to 596, your searches in Google's top three climbed from 16 to 57. To grow further against competitors like pixelfield.co.uk, who hold 1,469 linking websites and a strength in Google's eyes of 408 compared to your 503 websites and 291, the focus must be on resolving internal search overlap and turning existing traffic into enquiries."
    ],
